  "description": "Inject raw energy, street attitude, and bold underground vibes into your creative projects with Urban Chunk, a high-impact handmade display font! Inspired by urban graffiti culture and street art aesthetics, this heavy-weight typeface features chunky, bubble-style shapes, organic curves, and a hand-crafted rhythm that brings an authentic, rebellious edge to your designs. It is the absolute premier choice for streetwear apparel brands, graffiti-inspired logos, skate deck graphics, album covers, poster titles, sticker designs, and high-energy merchandise layouts.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Inject raw energy, street attitude, and bold underground vibes into your creative projects with Urban Chunk, a high-impact handmade display font! Inspired by urban graffiti culture and street art aesthetics, this heavy-weight typeface features chunky, bubble-style shapes, organic curves, and a hand-crafted rhythm that brings an authentic, rebellious edge to your designs. It is the absolute premier choice for streetwear apparel brands, graffiti-inspired logos, skate deck graphics, album covers, poster titles, sticker designs, and high-energy merchandise layouts.</p>",
